/E (Aumyaa Consulting Services LLP is a women lead and managed tech enabled consulting firm to provide high-impact solutions to global businesses. We provide services in the area of Sustainability and ESG Consulting, Business Consulting, Risk Consulting, and Technology Consulting. Aumyaa provides services to listed and unlisted companies across almost all the industry sectors. ESG consulting services include developing Sustainability/ESG strategy with specific goals, ESG Materiality and Risk Assessment, Supply Chain Assessment, Net Zero Transition, Business Responsibility and Sustainability Reporting, and Assurance.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
