/E (Our leaders are self-made and have experience of BIG 4 and Fortune 500 companies and have served clients across the globe. They have served a diverse range of clients, spanning multinationals, listed companies, privately owned companies, and family-owned businesses in the domain of ESG, Risk and Technology Consulting. Aumyaa believes in taking guidance and learning from nature for delivering creative, innovative simple cost-effective solutions. Our guiding principle is to develop long lasting relationships with our stakeholders based on our integrity, trust and quality deliverables. We continuously learn to improve daily and remain calm and balanced through collective value creation.)
