/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As we present this Environmental, Social, and Governance \(ESG\) report, we are proud to share the commitments we uphold at Aumyaa and the strategy to achieve them. Our dedication to sustainability and social responsibility is not just a compliance requirement, it is a core component of our business strategy and culture. We have consistently recognized our ESG responsibilities as essential to our goal of creating a positive impact on the society and environment. We are dedicated to conducting business in an environmentally and socially responsible manner, aiming to safeguard the environment, preserve resources, and promote sustainable development. Our services to our clients have potential to drive efficiencies through optimized usage of resources. As we look ahead, we remain focused on enhancing our ESG initiatives. We will continue to engage with our stakeholders and clients to understand their concerns and expectations, ensuring that our environmental, social, and governance strategies align with their values. Together, we can build a resilient and responsible business that contributes positively to society while delivering value to our stakeholders.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
