/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This Survey was conducted through discussions and polls during four series of ESG Webinars organized by Aumyaa. There were respondents representing various sectors and who were either from corporates or providing ESG consulting services. By engaging participants from different sectors and backgrounds, the survey aimed to provide a comprehensive understanding of current practices, challenges, and opportunities in the field of ESG reporting and assurance.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
