/E (The analysis indicates that organizations majority y rely on external methods to stay updated with evolving BRSR regulations. A third of organizations participate in industry forums and seminars, while another third consult with external advisors and experts. Additionally, a third of organizations regularly review regulatory updates from authorities. While internal training and awareness programs could play a crucial role in fostering a deeper understanding of BRSR requirements among employees, they are currently underutilized as information sources. By investing in internal training, organizations can empower their employees to better integrate ESG principles into their daily work and drive more sustainable business practices. )
